                   range of entity-related tasks. In particular, it obtains
                   state-of-the-art results on five well-known datasets: Open
                   Entity (entity typing), TACRED (relation classification),
                   CoNLL-2003 (named entity recognition), ReCoRD (cloze-style
                   question answering), and SQuAD 1.1 (extractive question
                   answering). Our source code and pretrained representations
                   are available at https://github.com/studio-ousia/luke.",
  month         =  oct,
  year          =  2020,
